			"notes": "### Bug Fixes\n- Fixed bugged generation\n- Fixed some skinwalker bugs\n- Fixed some other bugs that I'm probably forgetting\n\n### New Features\n- Added an option for integrated servers to change the exit spawn radius (the default is now 300 blocks instead of 1,000)\n- Added a dedicated server option for changing the exit spawn radius (backrooms-exit-spawn-radius)\n- Added an option to disable hints on world join\n\n### Optimizations\n- Scaled down textures (242mb -> 112mb)\n- Reworked level transitions\n- Reworked PBR materials\n\n### Translations\n- French\n- Spanish (Spain, Mexico, and Catalan)\n- Turkish\n- Updated Russian"
